 "id": "c_mi_071",
 "prompt": "On a soft grassy meadow, a red-and-white checkered picnic blanket is spread beneath a blooming oak tree, with a wicker picnic basket open to reveal glass wine bottles and ceramic plates. Two crusty baguettes lie beside a wheel of cheese and a bunch of purple grapes. A wooden cutting board holds sliced tomatoes, olives, and a loaf of dark bread. A stainless-steel thermos stands next to a porcelain mug, while a plate of chocolate brownies sits next to a bowl of fresh strawberries. A straw hat rests on the edge of the blanket near a checkered napkin and stainless-steel cutlery. Nearby, a vintage vinyl record player plays music beside a rolled-up map and a pair of binoculars. A meadowlark perches on a branch overhead, and a ladybug crawls on a dandelion near the blanket’s fringe. There is no plastic cooler, no metal grill, no paper plate, no cellphone, and no Frisbee.",
